    "body_text": "Skip to Main Content\nSeaTac Municipal Code\nTitle 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\nHelp\nText Size: -A +A\nAdvanced Search\nContents\n\nClick the plus (+) or minus (-) symbols to expand or collapse the entries. Click the checkboxes to select sections for saving or printing.\n\n\nClear all\n\n+\nTitle 1 GENERAL PROVISIONS\n\n+\nTitle 2 ADMINISTRATION AND PERSONNEL\n\n+\nTitle 3 REVENUE AND FINANCE\n\n+\nTitle 4 RENTAL HOUSING\n\n+\nTitle 5 BUSINESS LICENSES AND REGULATIONS\n\n+\nTitle 6 ANIMALS\n\n+\nTitle 7 HEALTH AND SAFETY\n\n+\nTitle 8 PUBLIC PEACE, MORALS AND WELFARE\n\n+\nTitle 9 VEHICLES AND TRAFFIC\n\n+\nTitle 10 CODE COMPLIANCE\n\n+\nTitle 11 STREETS, SIDEWALKS, AND PUBLIC THOROUGHFARES\n\n+\nTitle 12 PUBLIC UTILITIES\n\n+\nTitle 13 BUILDINGS AND CONSTRUCTION\n\n+\nTitle 14 SUBDIVISIONS\n\n+\nTitle 15 ZONING CODE\n\n+\nTitle 16A DEVELOPMENT REVIEW CODE\n\n+\nTitle 17 CRIME PREVENTION THROUGH ENVIRONMENTAL DESIGN (CPTED)\n\n+\nTitle 18 ENVIRONMENTAL CODE\n\n+\nSTATUTORY REFERENCES FOR WASHINGTON CITIES AND TOWNS\n\n–\nORDINANCE TABLE\n\n–\nTABLE OF STATE STATUTES ADOPTED BY REFERENCE\n\n  \nTitle 1\nGENERAL PROVISIONS\n\nChapters:\n\n1.01    Code Adoption\n\n1.10    Initiative and Referendum Procedure\n\n1.15    Repealed\n\n1.20    Hearing Examiner System\n\n1.25    Repealed\n\n1.30    Interlocal Agreements\n\n1.35    City Logo\n\n1.40    Right-of-Way Acquisition Procedures and Relocation Assistance Appeals\n\n  \n\nThe SeaTac Municipal Code is current through Ordinance 26-1008, passed March 24, 2026.\n\nDisclaimer: The City Clerk’s office has the official version of the SeaTac Municipal Code. Users should contact the City Clerk’s office for ordinances passed subsequent to the ordinance cited above.\n\nCity Website: https://www.seatacwa.gov/\nCity Telephone: (206) 973-4800\n\nCodification services provided by General Code",
